# AI Optimize Identity Decision
# .ai-optimize/project.json is NOT gitignored because it represents canonical
# project identity that must travel with the repository. It is the single source
# of truth for stable project ID across all operations, migrations, and clones.
# Unlike backups and lock files (which are ephemeral runtime state), project.json
# is intended to be committed and versioned alongside project-profile.json.

